      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. it's a good start, but i just ran it through our internal sentiment tool and the positivity score is actually a bit lower than i'd hoped for an emergency appeal. it's coming back a little too \"neutral\" or \"matter-of-fact.\"\n\ncan you try a second version? we really need to lean into the emotional weight of this so the score reflects how much is at stake. just remember—don't go overboard or make it sound like a movie trailer, i still need it to be credible. just make it more moving/positive about the potential impact so the sentiment score picks up on that hope.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
